            <ArticleTitle>Gravitational lumbar traction.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>510-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Low back and extremity pain is often secondary to inflammation of the nerve root or sinuvertebral nerve. Gravitational lumbar reduction therapy may relieve such pain. The results in a series of 121 cases are presented.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
